    "text": "<p><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> Quadratic expression is positive, hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> and</p><p><math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><